{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c271176a5362a5e78374a7d07e6683eb7808221e5f541fff12e8c589b930c798",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f4b6bea2615d2e07f6da9750bdd11f7e515e677043c89b2c0a4d8c638c3cb11",
      "text": "最强的生日礼物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9c871a3b00811fecfda1a02b83ad9b873a1ae57ac2d106ef70ae504417edc10",
      "text": "悠介找到制作人，希望能商量一下送给享介的生日礼物。一边穿插着过去的回忆，悠介一边与制作人一同敲定礼物的候选名单。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f4b6bea2615d2e07f6da9750bdd11f7e515e677043c89b2c0a4d8c638c3cb11",
      "text": "最强的生日礼物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:992e16814af6fcfbdd76bb59d0d02951f8b1d0f73a13a955d11b1b80cb72fc6b",
      "text": "监督，拜托啦！\n跟我商量一下送享介的生日礼物吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:129c92862ad86dacc1bd2a0283ad93e1939bb02cf5c08bcdca48fe1e6b9b9a7f",
      "text": "当然可以！\n不过，找我商量可以吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:267b9239c9c6b216a9993a94a46fe0f2a3045607813e76e69e8805e7fac99c02",
      "text": "嗯，就要找监督！\n我想送一个能让享介大吃一惊的生日礼物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7331b5837cc9f487d4f98f93f3b13ad9a064f5a0299fbc82709b4d66196babb4",
      "text": "感觉跟监督一起的话，就能挑出很厉害的东西呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5685742ce03615afd325c86bcb089daa4379d72e3253e2fec6584c340bff90ef",
      "text": "明白了！那我们就来找找很棒的礼物吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db13e9e27ed1e37ec14e3ff320729970787d92b415adf3691676daf4b4898b8a",
      "text": "谢谢！\n今年一定要让享介大吃一惊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f611bd20e0ff14d974911cd71d2207b67c7008624445d6f236e15342a9ce883",
      "text": "很有干劲呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a82d94124f369cb0bcefda175a52c583be811ec822887de8abb09461e7e5946",
      "text": "嗯，那是当然啦。\n因为之前一直都是平手嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05a0e1330be4347c373ae638bf7b4d0adb8578fe38c5bcd8a557c19f6c51ef6a",
      "text": "正因为彼此十分了解，\n才会打成平手呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8dde2c5de1a90e9d297d0eb31da3b2915e8d783cbb2442c37176bf11c3b881b7",
      "text": "话是这么说啦。在做偶像工作的时候、\n或者平时都挺好的，可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9ba8a94a1fd7ddb2ec2a0e996cd79162d166b3e05d43873fbdfe8fe164dbb57",
      "text": "现在正因为这个原因超级让人犯愁啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc0f85aaa75c81068f8673812fda53655e497ad78bbfaded93f3a1c9651972a2",
      "text": "能证明我们互相了解的事例可多啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8c2470091d952562216ffee65de345139930b7d322cb2ef1642c2a53d6a764c",
      "text": "最近一次生日，我们送了彼此同款不同色的鞋子。\n那个时候真是惊呆了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:048592ae7ce4ceabad4a6b9c9894dafa99d0be92c1b38475dbc412045b17ff3f",
      "text": "毕竟一开盒子，\n里面装着跟我送的完全一模一样的鞋子啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af998cec014fb4d31d183db0d30fd1c7f72edcb0affc30ed7695e7f4a5ba1247",
      "text": "我一愣，转头去看享介。\n发现那家伙果然也一脸惊讶。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18286342e9016028b01ed4443655cb1510ad492aca4c83295af1b5944a61f12f",
      "text": "发现两个人想的都一样，我们俩直接大笑了起来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbe7da1d65ee662b6a0dfd461b43ce4b3d369a2a6e98350fb7752fd0d40fde6b",
      "text": "眼前浮现出悠介先生和享介先生互动的画面了。\n真是令人愉快的平局呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cc9e0f8b8209e8095ae1d839ded2fa6006047b99a6b45f671ff561004600b99",
      "text": "虽然挺有趣的，但还是想赢啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_b:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bfdb7cb1ebb625bc8efa180e9cf107c7d090111a6ef79e7b84f8b30e09019ba",
      "text": "大概就是这样，这种事情一直持续着，\n所以这次我真的很想赢一次啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_c:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6c1101f3e45efac4c410ab8b77dcef1822895d3535a8e87bdc89fc5d73d0abe",
      "text": "可是，实在想不到什么绝妙的礼物啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0df518e0f12544f6d1487a673aeedd586951c0dd7ffa7e5fb15150af6abf10e",
      "text": "我经常会问周围的人，\n送什么礼物比较好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6b272e49012c11267780be21ca1b8df58e864c579aa8c554d1a667df7d9437c",
      "text": "之前也找高中的学弟商量过，\n问到了很多……但都感觉不太对。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7aa5c2ec105d851d08b28029b024436c94159855dd035748f65adae50ef98031",
      "text": "比如当时班里流行的东西、\n高中生之间很有人气的东西，我都不是很熟嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5f8df5fff98910d5640850a1ec809e7432a5c9bd978ace99cc7e8f67c8322ea",
      "text": "足球相关的话我倒是一下子就能明白。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbe19ecf27d368fe82333a6c1bfe023ad84e83c8ea474a6e0eda138efdad1de1",
      "text": "但足球以外的东西就……\n那时候的话题我也稍微有点跟不上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac1b8ee27507663a8c92ed64dcddd26fefec04adc518dd0d5f59fb7fa207806e",
      "text": "想要送出自己也觉得好的东西，\n这种心情我好像能理解。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58fdeb0018ec0ac1533b78e588365eb658faa013ab3aa725a74659ffd59445e8",
      "text": "嘿嘿。就是这样啦。\n所以我才来找监督了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a01b438dca1788a3d80e035c8bb9f26ff31367a4910b61e48a6ae782cba37a3d",
      "text": "毕竟因为工作关系，监督见过各种各样的事物，\n感觉知道得很多！就是这么想的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b058662e64ab7df8c279a4193d92bd883769dc411587fc71d2e1466832e85b51",
      "text": "而且监督也很了解我们对吧？\n我觉得我的直觉准没错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_d:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98c5e619104d8d0ceb63e014f08c46056bbb992da9c8c3309326b52ba17bcaaf",
      "text": "啊！\n难道说，享介已经先一步来商量过了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd65bf4378ed35e40be8d23c879964569b17dc8adb2063bc483206a59d9c88e8",
      "text": "等等等等，先别告诉我答案！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff549af0f0605fed58166e97d83d49277b10b8bdbd5b10d0b2139b68a27becd8",
      "text": "既然我来找监督商量了，\n那家伙肯定也会来商量的吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05c410b3eb9fe8891855123e18831f5a663cfade1118f23d94b8cabcb269fbb7",
      "text": "就算他来商量了，也请假装什么都不知道哦！\n给提示也不行哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec63c641878707a20c6b40ca3121966d200197e1fdf3b5bb64ff10444c17145a",
      "text": "呵呵，我知道了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_d:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec523d992d2070f6769673ff9477a1e1cfd713e6ef407c4ad94d71a250850efd",
      "text": "谢谢你，监督！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2f392118f6783aacc8ab329811df125693e1fab128d2a7d390faa982d9af140",
      "text": "让我们两个人一起挑出\n能让享介先生大吃一惊的礼物吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d21896b1ccd742e34eaf284728cb42e727984a61837573da0ea713b21fc5e6a5",
      "text": "能告诉我以前都送过些什么吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1ac664ee7da4a50394b67a18bf6a406f0465bc63b89f0c57e0b7fd65fa4534f",
      "text": "你看你看。这些就是至今为止送过的东西的照片！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3e7ac531f2e3096a742dc1ba696416b294fe695a98095d4d31be0e4c54a19f5",
      "text": "好，清单列好了！\n真不愧是监督！知道的东西真多！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14777d0b48965719bdfb8d074339ef91c446e6a450cc4183dfcac241b7c983ec",
      "text": "也很了解我们。\n这个和这个，享介应该也会高兴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c029ce29c7b880bb6d0c185dfc8425a472b41ba10c304cf3696b58ad2ddf84c",
      "text": "啊，不过这个也很棒啊。\n我自己都想要了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77401515f4af9bd025aed18249e51d232897af7ee4d34b0c119e572ca73214c1",
      "text": "唔——不过如果以吓他一跳为目的，\n绝对是这个吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dde940d011501c27301b45dc82ec18d41275ea1e655a23bd402400bb69d0c05b",
      "text": "不对，像监督说的那样，把以前送过的东西\n再送一次来吓他一跳，说不定也不错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d8352cf171b04b187b2a8fc96df0c3d577c2d30042474d78f69e8190dae3a9b",
      "text": "这个是消耗品，最近也没见他在用了，\n送这个的话搞不好会让他大吃一惊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6517885b3a7dac57f6e7846adf9c7f403c96ff49ef5a44868b129ef4466c655",
      "text": "怎么办啊。好纠结啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8652633d911067ceb7c6423062a70f41b02972e8981018af5fc33e42b1bdb4eb",
      "text": "要送哪一个，不如直接去实地看看商品再决定吧？\n我会陪你一起去的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5a193e1b1ff78645e5590c8b673473741b22a280e849a1a98c8494202135f21",
      "text": "真的吗？太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_012yus_01_1_2_012_01:1_2_012_01_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bbc2fa6480c715f6d860ae942fb69bb1a4186b86a0c251afdcdfef7f3e898b4b",
      "text": "一起去买东西的日子，定下来吧！\n什么时候有空？快告诉我，监督！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
